
                             Zeus Menubar v1.1

                         ©1995-1996 by Rod Schnell


Description
~~~~~~~~~~~
 Generates a nice 3D look ANSI bar showing menu location (status), time
 remaining and a short random quote... The whole thing uses 3 lines. See the
 included screencap for an example of what it looks like.


Features
~~~~~~~~
 - Zeus Door.
 - Shows location as taken from the status string (up to 16 chars from left,
   complete words only).
 - Shows time remaining.
 - Very fast random quote routines, even with huge quote files.
 - Can show force text instead of random quote.
 - Can specify colors to suit each time it's run.
 - Can use different quote files or force non-random text each time it's run.


Caveats
~~~~~~~
 - Looks best with 8Bit codes (IBM font) and 16 color ANSI turned on.
 - Quote files should be one quote per line, of no more than 40 characters
   each, longer quotes will simply be truncated to fit.


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
 To install for use online, simple copy Menubar to doors: and use the
 following to run it anywhere.

 ZDoor '"Menubar 'Line'"' NOLOG

 Note - It is recommended you use ZDoor NOLOG option to prevent your logs
        from getting big too quickly.


Arguments
~~~~~~~~~
 Menubar takes 1 required and 4 optional arguments.

 LINE       - Required arg, the current line number.
  
 COLOR      - The color to be used for Location and time. 0 = Black,
              1 = Red, 2 = Green, 3 = Yellow, 4 = Blue, 5 = Cyan,
              6 = Magenta. White is not allowed, since it's used to make
                  the bar. If not given defaults to 2 (green)

 QUOTECOLOR - The color (same as above) to be used for Quote text (both
              random and forced quotes). If not given, defaults to 0 (black).
   
 QUOTEFILE  - Full path to the random quotes file, if not given defaults
              to "zeus:config/MenuBar/MenuBar.Quotes". Shows error msg when
              quote file isn't found. Quote files should contain one quote
              per line, with no more than 40 characters each, longer quotes
              will simply be truncated to fit.

 QUOTE      - Forced quote text, if not given will use a random quote.
              If this arg and QUOTEFILE are both given, QUOTEFILE will be
              ignored.
   
 See the included Arexx script MenubarDemo.zeus for example useage... This is
 a NextScript type script.


History
~~~~~~~
 - v1.0 - First version, released 05-Aug-96.
 - v1.1 - 19-Oct-96
        - Shaved slightly more than 1K off the program size, by recompiling
          to use only Printf() instead of both Printf() and printf(). 


